      "created_at": "2018-03-18T16:58:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well in one sense, parts of it are revealed every week on the Letters Page podcast.&nbsp; But there's also been talk of releasing a History of Sentinel Comics book.&nbsp; As far as I know, we don't have a timeline on that yet, but maybe there'll be more information about that with the RPG Kickstarter?</p>",
