      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/46a35a/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-03-19T17:58:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A friend and I have been trying to build out a big list of fights to kind of play through the history of the multiverse.&nbsp; So having the list of when all the books really came out and any info on what happened in there would be so useful.</p><p>There are a lot of places where fights are very hard to place because of inconsistancys with book ordering or characters being pictured in books they are not supposed to be in.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>The southwest sentinals in particular are just so screwed up on the art.</p>",
